(TRACE AI Reference Manual - Page 1: Database Connection Pool Runbook) Tj
T* (System: orders_db / db-proxy | Max Pool Size: 100 active connections) Tj
T* (Warning Threshold: 70 active connections | Critical Threshold: 95 active connections) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Symptom: ConnectionPoolExhausted or requests queued waiting for DB slot.) Tj
T* (Root Causes:) Tj
T* (1. Long-running analytics or batch jobs \(such as nightly_analytics_sync\) opening) Tj
T* (   bulk read cursors without a statement or idle-in-transaction timeout.) Tj
T* (2. Application workers holding idle-in-transaction connections during peak load.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Remediation Steps:) Tj
T* (- Identify stalled queries holding idle-in-transaction connections in db-proxy.) Tj
T* (- Terminate offending batch jobs during peak traffic hours.) Tj
T* (- Verify db_pool_active drops below 30/100 after reclaiming leaked connections.) Tj
ET
endstream
