(TRACE AI Reference Manual - Page 3: Batch Governance & Recovery Checklist) Tj
T* (Policy: Heavy batch jobs \(nightly_analytics_sync\) must only run 01:00-04:00 UTC.) Tj
T* (Manual execution during daytime peak traffic requires SRE approval and a) Tj
T* (read-replica connection string with max_connections=15.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Post-Incident Verification Checklist:) Tj
T* (1. Confirm cpu_percent < 40% and memory_percent < 60% for 5 consecutive minutes.) Tj
T* (2. Confirm error_rate returns below 0.005 \(0.5%\) across all endpoints.) Tj
T* (3. Record incident timeline across CSV metrics, app logs, and ops tickets.) Tj
T* (4. Add connection timeout guardrails to analytics-worker before re-running jobs.) Tj
ET
endstream
